            <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black">Calm &amp; comfortable day</h3>
            <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm text-white/90">
              <li>Start from the developed areas near parking and seating.</li>
              <li>Allocate time for playgrounds and short flat walking trails.</li>
              <li>Keep direct supervision near edges and slopes.</li>
              <li>Avoid peak crowding with an early or after-noon visit.</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
          <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-[var(--forest-900)] p-7">
            <p class="text-sm font-black text-[var(--sand)]">Nature photographers</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black">Hunt the fog &amp; overlooks</h3>
            <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm text-white/90">
              <li>Watch low clouds form in the morning and the changing overlook.</li>
              <li>Target upper overlooks and safe edges for wide angles.</li>
              <li>Try golden hours near sunrise and sunset.</li>
              <li>Respect others\' paths and prepared trails when moving.</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
          <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-[var(--forest-900)] p-7">
            <p class="text-sm font-black text-[var(--sand)]">Seniors / limited mobility</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black">Prepared trails &amp; rest</h3>
            <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm text-white/90">
              <li>Use adapted parking and paved trails.</li>
              <li>Distribute rest at benches and shaded areas.</li>
              <li>Avoid steep or unprepared trails.</li>
              <li>Stay near main facilities for services.</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

