              <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--forest-700)] text-white font-black">3</span><span>Rest at seating and the playground area for families.</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--forest-700)] text-white font-black">4</span><span>Light photo tour at a safe edge, then return before the crowd.</span></li>
            </ol>
