              <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--forest-700)] text-white font-black">1</span><span>Morning in Raghadan Forest: trails, overlooks, lavender garden and developed areas.</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--forest-700)] text-white font-black">2</span><span>Lunch in Al Bahah city among the available restaurants and cafés.</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--forest-700)] text-white font-black">3</span><span>Afternoon: a nearby landmark like the historical Raghadan market or Prince Hussam Park.</span></li>
